Not at all. I knocked it up in about an hour. You can find the patch
at: http://www.cse.unsw.edu.au/~malcolmr/nethack/3.4.3/mining.diff

Basically I made dwarvish iron helms equivalent to brass lanterns for
most of their uses. And dwarves in dark mines start with their helmets
on.

I haven't tested it thoroughly. Bug reports and other feedback is
appreciated.

My only lingering concern is that you currently don't have to wear a
helmet to use the light. This seems wrong. Perhaps they should
automatically turn off when you remove them from your head?

